WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.880
My name is Liu Maoxing.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.360
People call me Mao.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.390
To learn cooking,

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.930
I came to Yang Spring Restaurant

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:42.920
which is the best restaurant of Guangzhou.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:44.450
The first test I took

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:46.190
is fried bok choy.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.020
I racked my brains to

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:49.080
deal with the earthy smell of loess.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.320
And I overcame this difficulty in the end.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.780
Now I wanna appoint you as

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.080
fourth-class chef who's responsible for bok choy.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.870
You need to be prepared for the strict training.

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.260
And my cooking practice finally started.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.280
Ruthless! The Rule of Yang Spring Restaurant!

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.000
Hey! The fire there is too small!

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:16.180
Sorry.

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:17.500
There is no time for us to zone out!

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.310
Hey! When will you bring me the dish?

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:25.320
OK. OK.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:26.440
I'm coming!

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.270
It hurts.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.970
Hey. Why are you lying there?

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.200
How dare you ask me?

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.380
You tripped me just now.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.860
Look. Vegetables are dirty because of you.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.520
Looks like you need to wash them again.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.600
Pick them up now!

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.770
Punk, I have a question.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.680
Why on earth are you staring at me like that?

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.740
Well, pick them up. Pick them up.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.140
Meili.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:12.400
If my father sees that,

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.660
he'll scold you.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:14.470
Mao,

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.930
don't be discouraged by such a little thing.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:23.970
I know.

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:25.110
Because it's also

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.220
one of the practices of being a Super Chef.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.190
Sanjie, I washed all vegetables.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.930
Really, why did it take you so long to wash them?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:37.700
Sorry.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.720
Then what should I do now?

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.110
Well, peel the potatoes

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.840
and cut them into shreds.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:50.180
But cutting is your job, right?

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:50.840
What?

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:55.270
Mao,

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.610
I let you hold the kitchen knife for the sake of you.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.680
How dare you say....

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.030
How dare you...

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:05.870
Sanjie.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.230
Hey, stop it.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.100
Sanjie,

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.390
your father is also

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.950
a famous chef, right?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.220
Your behavior

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.650
has brought disgrace on your father.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.510
Shut up!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.360
Don't mention my father!

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.740
Geez. So boring.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:27.430
What's wrong with Sanjie?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.270
He's the only child and inheritor of

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.500
a big restaurant in Shanghai.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.330
But he's really hopeless.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.220
Only child and inheritor?

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.410
He's spiteful and impatient.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.710
You're unlucky to

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.250
be assigned to him.

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:41.800
Don't overthink the problem.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:42.560
Keep it up!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:43.320
OK.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.580
I'm so tired.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.720
My arms and legs feel fatigued.

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:37.870
It's so late.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.460
Who is practicing shaking the pot?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.160
Who is he?

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:48.760
Sanjie!

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.620
The pot is shiny

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.810
and those grains of rice are so dark.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.520
They can't

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.810
change into like that in only one to two days.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:21.170
Sanjie seems to be so lazy,

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:21.910
but he...

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.160
What? Sanjie...

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.140
I saw him

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.650
practice shaking the pot alone at midnight.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.720
The pot is shinny

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.200
and those grains of rice are very dark.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.160
So I guess

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.400
he must practice shaking the pot

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.520
every night.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.610
That lazy Sanjie.

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:45.490
I can't believe it.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.100
Actually, Sanjie is very enthusiastic

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.020
about cooking in his mind.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.380
You can tell it from the fact that he gets up and

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.970
practices shaking the pot at midnight.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.110
Why are you standing there?

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.220
Don't keep customers waiting!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:06:59.440
Yes!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.890
Here you are. Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.970
Today's special dish is
shredded pork with green pepper.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.450
I've been waiting for you for a long time,
shredded pork with green pepper!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.600
It's my favorite dish!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:14.710
I didn't expect that

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:17.380
I can eat such a delicious home-style dish here by day.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:19.950
This restaurant is very good!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.710
Let's get started.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.040
I'm so busy.

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.280
There are so many plates.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.450
Do we have to wash all of them before sunset?

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.340
Well, stop complaining.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:44.950
This is also one of the practices.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.600
OK.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:49.970
It's so weird, Meili.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:51.560
Why are there so many leftovers of

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.640
shredded pork with green pepper today?

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.020
Besides, there are only vegetables left.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.960
Yes. You're right.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:57.750
Let me have a look.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.580
It tastes so bad.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:06.590
It hasn't satisfied

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.540
the basic requirements for
shredded pork with green pepper.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:09.140
Basic?

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:14.790
To make shredded pork with green pepper,
you need to mix and stir-fry

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:17.140
shredded pork, green pepper
and bamboo shoots together.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.240
It can be said to be the most basic dish

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.840
of hot stir-fried dishes.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.170
The key point should be obvious.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.460
The crispness of vegetables.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:26.370
(Crispness)

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.000
That is the pure and fresh texture.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.730
Then it's the tenderness of the pork.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.640
(Tenderness)

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.790
That is the suitable softness.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.460
The key point is

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:37.490
the wonderful combination of
the two opposite textures.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.310
(Crispness and Tenderness)

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.050
But, look at the bamboo shoot.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.910
It's not as crispy as other vegetables.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:46.870
Why?

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.720
You're right. It's already tough.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.550
I think there is no problem with the ingredients.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.910
And the seasonings are also right.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.720
If so...

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:05.960
Yes, I'm right.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:11.040
The sizes of vegetables are very different

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.340
That's too much.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.040
The cooking temperature cannot be unified.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.750
If you fit the cooking temperature
for the thickest vegetable,

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.900
all the other vegetables

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.780
will definitely be like that tough.

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.170
Who cut vegetables into that?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:25.730
I'm sorry.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.200
I cut those vegetables.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.270
Sanjie.

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:32.740
I made this dish.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.370
Do you have a problem with

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.170
the dish I made?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.290
Do you understand now, Sanjie?

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:52.950
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.110
Father.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:58.100
I... I understand, Chef Zhou Yu.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.790
Father, what do you mean?

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:03.110
The rule of Yang Spring Restaurant is
to obey the quota system.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.340
Quota system?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.930
That means after a newcomer joins,

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:07.650
a person will have to leave.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.690
It's a known strict rule of this restaurant.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.750
After Mao joins,

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.780
a fourth-class chef has to leave.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.340
This dish today

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:18.430
is the last chance

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:21.000
that Chef Zhou Yu gave to Sanjie.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:23.560
What done is done.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:28.030
It's totally a corollary of Sanjie's lack

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.300
of enthusiasm for cooking.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:31.440
No way.

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:34.690
Sanjie even practices at midnight.

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:37.080
How can he lack enthusiasm for cooking?

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.960
It's good, right?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.630
We can take the chance to get rid of a slacker.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.570
No, that's true!

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.490
Sanjie, is it really good for you?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.410
You worked hard to be the successor

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.640
to your father, right?

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:56.780
Sanjie!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.550
Shut up!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.910
I can't stay in a restaurant like that!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.900
I don't want to be a chef anymore!

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.160
Sanjie.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:19.840
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.360
What should I do, Meili?

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.600
It's not your fault, Mao.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:27.660
Right.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.780
It's inevitable that lazy people

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.740
will be eliminated.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.930
The cooking career is tough.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.960
Mao is very weird.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.070
Just a

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.730
spiteful fellow apprentice left.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.330
Great. Guys, let's rest until we prepare for the dinner.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:42.050
OK.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:42.790
Mao,

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.290
go clean Sanjie's room

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:46.930
after you wash all the plates.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.690
From tonight, you'll sleep there.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:51.690
Did you hear me?

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:53.370
Yes.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:00.650
The room is really in a mess.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.380
It needs to be cleaned.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:03.940
Honestly!

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.770
Why did Sanjie mess up the room like that?

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.400
This... This is...

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:14.650
What's wrong?

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.470
Look at this kitchen knife.

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:19.280
Blades of normal kitchen knives are like that big.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:20.250
But take a look.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.000
There is only half of the blade left.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.790
It suggests that someone often uses it.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.290
Sanjie is not a slacker at all.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:33.630
Actually, he's full of enthusiasm for cooking.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.560
I must stop him.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:40.280
Mao, where are you going?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.960
Sanjie!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.880
Wait, Sanjie.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.000
It's you.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:12:59.440
Sanjie,

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.950
everyone says that you're a slacker.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.270
But I don't think so.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.790
It's your stuff, right?

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.120
The pot has become so shiny.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.190
Half of the kitchen knife's blade is gone.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:15.840
Sanjie, you're so aspiring.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.230
Why did you cut the vegetables like that?

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.010
Why didn't you let others know

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.390
what you're capable of?

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.510
I think you have greater enthusiasm

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.050
for cooking than anyone else does.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.740
I don't wanna be a chef anymore.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.890
Sanjie, why? Why?

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.550
None of your business!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.190
How can you understand my feelings?

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.030
You can't leave!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.770
Let me go!

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:44.660
I will never let you go!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.240
What should we do?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.290
The restaurant is opening soon.

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.120
You idiot.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:07.860
Because of you, I'm soaking wet like this.

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.800
And I missed that ship.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:12.770
It's all your fault.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.400
Sorry.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.560
Sanjie,

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.120
why did you cut the vegetables like that?

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:27.330
Mao,

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:28.710
you've grown up in the kitchen

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.840
of Chrysanthemum Tower of Sichuan.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.960
I have grown up in the kitchen

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:35.070
(Longzhen Restaurant)
of Longzhen Restaurant just like you do.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:37.780
At that time,

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:39.300
I really admired my father.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.140
I hope I can be a chef like him.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:43.880
I've been hoping for it since I was young.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.000
My father is very strict about

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.180
both cooking and parenting.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.230
In order to inherit Longzhen Restaurant,

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.700
I've been receiving strict training since I was young.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.350
What do you think of it, Sanjie?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:14:59.350
Is it good?

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:01.860
Very good, father.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:02.700
Really?

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:04.450
Then tell me

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.060
what ingredients

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:06.380
does this stock contain?

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:10.630
It contains beef, vegetables, sweet miso,

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:15.190
dehydrated mushrooms, kombu and sansho peppers.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.350
And...

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:18.550
There is one more ingredient.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.090
And...

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:26.850
It's such a simple question,

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.020
but you can't answer it!

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:33.240
It's the walnut!

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:34.850
It's the walnut powder!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.630
Great. Well done.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:52.290
256, 257, 258, 259.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.050
Sanjian, why are you keeping slowing down?

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.580
It's so cold.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.330
My hands are nearly frozen stiff.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:02.890
You're talking nonsense!

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:05.740
No matter what the situation is,

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.100
the chef has to cook.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.160
If you can't even do that,

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.850
you will never be qualified to
inherit Longzhen Restaurant.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.120
My father's strict training was continuous.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.260
Sanjie, what's wrong with you?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.640
It's not thin enough.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.110
Have you forgotten that the daikon of Longzhen Restaurant

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:29.280
is known as moon halo?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.450
Make it transparent without breaking it.

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:33.900
When you look through it,

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.440
the \"full moon\" looks like a halo.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:36.860
That slice which will

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.750
immediately melt in your throat
has the best thickness.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:43.400
Daikons of Longzhen Restaurant

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.260
should be cut into thin slices like that.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:48.930
Listen, Sanjie.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.000
It's a training in slicing things thinly this time.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:53.710
Don't stop until you can cut all daikons

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:54.770
into something like the moon halo.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.090
You can't go to sleep before you complete this task!

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.180
Father.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:14.370
Sanjie.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:19.490
Mother, I always wonder

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.440
if father hates me so much.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.710
So he deliberately...

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:26.030
It's not true, Sanjie.

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.630
You father pins all his hopes

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.630
on your cooking skills.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.310
He hopes you can be the best chef

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:33.880
and make Longzhen Restaurant famous

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:36.700
all over the country.

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:38.750
So he's extremely strict with you.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.890
But...

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.420
Sanjie!

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.430
I cut my hand by accident,

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:05.100
but my father...

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:06.930
You idiot.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.510
Why did you think about something else

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.900
when cooking the dish?

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:12.110
How's your daikon slice going?

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:14.820
I'm asking you how it is going!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:24.100
Even you want to contradict me!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.080
Stop!

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.650
Finally, because I couldn't put up with him anymore,

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:39.480
I left my home and wandered everywhere.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.750
But when I stood in front of Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:47.870
the enthusiasm for cooking

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:49.540
which had been sealed in my mind was renewed.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.840
OK. I'm gonna learn again here.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.410
I must be

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:56.790
a chef who's even better than my father.

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.290
I thought so at that time.

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:00.700
However,

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:04.930
every time I see this scar,

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:07.090
I can't help thinking about what happened on that day.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:10.530
The heavy kitchen knife cut my flesh and bone sharply.

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.870
My blood splattered everywhere

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.630
and it hurt so bad.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.920
I'm scared when I just think about it.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.050
I can't hold the kitchen knife well.

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.860
A chef who cannot hold the kitchen knife.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.610
Do you think he has a promising future?

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:30.080
I can never become

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.270
a chef who's better than my father.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.540
I was tortured by the thought that I'm useless.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.440
When I recovered myself,

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:39.420
I felt like I was possessed.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.230
I spared no effort to shake the pot at midnight.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.490
I didn't know that

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.020
you have such a bitter experience.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.750
Sanjie, I'm so sorry.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.260
I misunderstood you.

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.520
Mao,

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.700
the reason why I bullied you

00:19:58.790 --> 00:19:59.900
is that I was so envious of you.

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:01.530
I saw you

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.540
study hard with absolutely no regrets.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:06.100
Sorry, I really shouldn't do that.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:09.440
Yang Spring Restaurant is an excellent restaurant.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:12.150
Mao, please work hard

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.020
and be a good chef for me.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.220
Sanjie, let's make shredded pork with
green pepper together.

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.660
We need to make it unprecedentedly delicious

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:24.950
to convince Chef Zhou Yu.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.750
What do you think?

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.590
Mao, what are you talking about?

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.820
I can't even hold the kitchen knife well.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.080
So we should cook it together.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.540
I'll cut vegetables.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.030
You're responsible for cooking them.

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:39.690
You had no choice but to try your best to
shake the pot at midnight.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:40.590
Just vent all of

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.740
this kind of frustration.

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:43.340
Right.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.240
If the dish made by you is delicious,

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:47.010
I believe my father will agree.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.550
But I've already been kicked out.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:50.790
Try again.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.220
Let's try to make

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:53.820
shredded pork with green pepper again.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.540
People all think that you're unambitious

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.240
and lazy.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:00.510
They said you're not enthusiastic about cooking.

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:01.810
Don't you feel disgruntled at the way

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.130
people criticize you?

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:05.800
Of course I do.

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:08.040
Sanjie, please don't give up your dream.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:11.590
My parents are both chefs,

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:13.870
so I think I can understand

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:15.070
some of your feelings.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:18.350
Sanjie, don't give up your dream of being a good chef.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:25.370
What do you think? Give it a try.

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.180
OK. I'll give it a try.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:30.540
Have a try, Sanjie!

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:35.870
Come on, Sanjie!

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.520
I'll also help you.

00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:18.080
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:21.357
I made a dish of shredded pork with green pepper
to impress Zhou Yu.

00:23:21.357 --> 00:23:25.069
We continued to work on it throughout the night,
but there was something different about it.

00:23:25.069 --> 00:23:27.822
Something is missing from
this dish of shredded pork with green pepper.

00:23:27.947 --> 00:23:29.700
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.825 --> 00:23:32.618
Break the Tradition! Defeat: Yang Spring Restaurant

00:23:32.702 --> 00:23:34.288
It will definitely be interesting!
